DESCRIPTION:Explore the traditions and principles of Kwanzaa through storyt
 elling\, art\, and hands-on activities.\n\nEvent website: https://www.plea
 setouchmuseum.org/visit/signature-events/\n\nListing: https://phillyfamily
 .com/event/kwanzaa-celebration-at-the-please-touch-museum/
