SUMMARY:Walnut Wonderland
LOCATION:Walnut Street Garden\, 1708 Walnut St\, Philadelphia\, PA 19103
DESCRIPTION:Walnut Garden transforms into Walnut Wonderland from December 2
 –31\, bringing holiday magic to its Rittenhouse cocktail garden with spa
 rkling Christmas lights\, festive decorations\, themed trees\, and a large
  Christmas tree. Visitors can enjoy seasonal food and drinks\, including h
 ot chocolate\, warm apple cider\, gingerbread churros\, and s’mores kits
  for roasting around the fire. A warming tent offers a cozy place to gathe
 r\, while special events like Santa visits\, a tree lighting\, and a Nearl
 y New…\n\nEvent website: https://www.phillyvoice.com/walnut-wonderland-p
 hiladelphia-holiday-pop-up-2026/\n\nListing: https://phillyfamily.com/even
 t/walnut-wonderland/2026-12-31/
