SUMMARY:Kids’ New Year’s Eve Countdown at the Square
LOCATION:Franklin Square\, 200 N 6th St\, Philadelphia\, PA 19106
DESCRIPTION:Families can welcome the New Year with a festive celebration at
  Holidays in Franklin Square. Enjoy family-friendly activities\, special g
 iveaways\, and seasonal entertainment leading up to the annual Square Drop
  at 6 PM. Guests can also catch views of the New Year’s Eve fireworks al
 ong the Waterfront from the Square. Franklin Square will close at 8 PM on 
 New Year’s Eve\n\nEvent website: https://historicphiladelphia.org/events
 /kids-new-years-eve-countdown/\n\nListing: https://phillyfamily.com/event/
