  ghostly Headless Horseman\, was based on a Hessian soldier who was decapi
 tated by cannonball fire.\n\nMeet in the Trenton and Princeton gallery dai
 ly at 12:30 p.m. (except Oct. 10-12) for this talk.\n\nEvent website: http
